ientious), stress resilience, technical (weather, computer). Weaknesses: grumpy, uncooperative (crew cooperation).\n\nC: can make correct decisions quickly, difficulty communicating ideas, regarded as egocentric, not very willing to further education, known to be 100% reliable, creates positive atmosphere with crew.\n\nStrengths: decision quality, reliability, crew cooperation (positive atmosphere). Weaknesses: communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education (adaptability).\n\nD: responds to unexpected events adequately, can concentrate very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, regarded as arrogant, relatively weak leadership skills.\n\nStrengths: adaptability (responds to unexpected), attention, problem solving, responsibility. Weaknesses: arrogance, weak leadership.\n\nWe need to pick best overall fit. Likely candidate C has reliability, decision making, crew atmosphere, but communication difficulty and egocentric may affect crew cooperation. B has stress handling but uncooperative. A has technical but unorganized. D has responsibility but arrogance and weak leadership.\n\nProbably C is strongest overall despite communication issues, but we need to discuss. As first contribution, we can propose candidate C, citing reliability, decision making, crew atmosphere, but note concerns about communication and education willingness. Provide recommendation.\n\nLet's produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE with vote C."}
